-- Yil'da <Witch of the Swamp> (255146) is the kill target of the Duo Delirium trials 613 and 614 (kill her before
-- level 44, in a duo), but she had no template.
-- Name, subtitle, rank, type, display and health/mana modifiers: Ascension client creature cache
-- (boxcoa/ascension-data, captured 2026-07 to 2026-09); her level, 44, is the trials' level limit.
-- Stand-in display: her own display 255146 is in no client archive (Game\Data with its realm folders and
-- ascension-live, checked 2026-10-31), not in the server DBCs or creaturedisplayinfo_dbc, and no mirror-image capture
-- of her exists, so Ascension streamed her look and it was never recorded. Display 9774 (Witch Doctor Mau'ari, a female
-- troll witch doctor) stands in for it, as it already does for Hirsutta the Witch (161790); the stand-in is estimated.
-- Health: as with the Trollbane Paragons, the cached modifier 8.0 is divided by the open-world health scaling at
-- level 44 (1.17 + 0.013 * 44), which trial targets do not receive on Ascension. Faction, damage modifier and gold
-- are estimates in line with those Paragons. Her spawn point, abilities and loot are unknown, so she is not spawned.
